SELECT
  @a_cet4_2023_12_1_03, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2023-12-1.mp3', 'News Report Two\n新闻二\n\nTwo men who have been best friends for 60 years have just realized they are actually brothers.\n两位男士做了60年的好朋友，刚刚意识到他们其实是兄弟。\n\nIt''s reported that Alan Robinson and Walter MacDonald met in the sixth grade at a school in Hawaii.\n据报道，艾伦·罗宾逊和沃尔特·麦克唐纳6年级时在夏威夷的一所学校认识。\n\nThey have been best friends ever since.\n从那以后，他们一直是最好的朋友。\n\nAlan was given away for adoption soon after he was born.\n艾伦出生后不久就被别人收养了。\n\nAnd Walter never knew his father.\n而且沃尔特也不知道他的父亲。\n\nSo recently, they made separate attempts on DNA-matching websites to discover more about their ancestry. Walter was astonished to find that he matched with website user Robi737.\n所以最近，他们分别在DNA匹配网站上进行了尝试，以发现更多关于他们祖先的信息。沃尔特惊讶地发现他与网站用户Robi737匹配。\n\nHe knew immediately that this was his best friend Alan, whose friends call him Robi and who flew 737 airplanes when he was a pilot.\n他立刻知道这是他最好的朋友艾伦，他的朋友们都叫他罗比，当他是一名飞行员时，他驾驶737飞机。\n\nThe pair were born to the same mother 15 months apart.\n这对兄弟是由同一位母亲所生，时间相差15个月。\n\nQuestions 3 and 4 are based on the news report you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第3题和第4题。\n\n3. What did both Alan Robinson and Walter MacDonald attempt to do on DNA-matching websites?\n3. 艾伦·罗宾逊和沃尔特·麦克唐纳都试图在DNA匹配网站上做什么？\n\n4. What did the news report say about Alan Robinson and Walter MacDonald?\n4. 关于艾伦·罗宾逊和沃尔特·麦克唐纳，新闻报道说了什么？', 59, 1413.12, 167.09, 225.63, 231.43, 251.43, 196.48, 210.94, 'cet4-2023-12-1-g02', 'NEWS', '[02:47.09]News Report Two｜新闻二\n[02:50.50]Two men who have been best friends for 60 years have just realized they are actually brothers.｜两位男士做了60年的好朋友，刚刚意识到他们其实是兄弟。\n[02:58.04]It''s reported that Alan Robinson and Walter MacDonald met in the sixth grade at a school in Hawaii.｜据报道，艾伦·罗宾逊和沃尔特·麦克唐纳6年级时在夏威夷的一所学校认识。\n[03:05.95]They have been best friends ever since.｜从那以后，他们一直是最好的朋友。\n[03:08.84]Alan was given away for adoption soon after he was born.｜艾伦出生后不久就被别人收养了。\n[03:13.79]And Walter never knew his father.｜而且沃尔特也不知道他的父亲。\n[03:16.48]So recently, they made separate attempts on DNA-matching websites to discover more about their ancestry. Walter was astonished to find that he matched with website user Robi737.｜所以最近，他们分别在DNA匹配网站上进行了尝试，以发现更多关于他们祖先的信息。沃尔特惊讶地发现他与网站用户Robi737匹配。\n[03:31.24]He knew immediately that this was his best friend Alan, whose friends call him Robi and who flew 737 airplanes when he was a pilot.｜他立刻知道这是他最好的朋友艾伦，他的朋友们都叫他罗比，当他是一名飞行员时，他驾驶737飞机。\n[03:40.55]The pair were born to the same mother 15 months apart.｜这对兄弟是由同一位母亲所生，时间相差15个月。\n[03:45.63]Questions 3 and 4 are based on the news report you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第3题和第4题。\n[03:51.43]3. What did both Alan Robinson and Walter MacDonald attempt to do on DNA-matching websites?｜3. 艾伦·罗宾逊和沃尔特·麦克唐纳都试图在DNA匹配网站上做什么？\n[04:14.91]4. What did the news report say about Alan Robinson and Walter MacDonald?｜4. 关于艾伦·罗宾逊和沃尔特·麦克唐纳，新闻报道说了什么？', NOW(), NOW()
