SELECT
  @a_cet4_2023_12_2_05, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2023-12-2.mp3', 'News Report Three\n新闻三\n\nA village is going to throw a birthday party for an orange cat named Wilbur, who has become famous for making a regular appearance at local shops.\n一个村庄将为一只名叫威尔伯的橘黄色猫举办生日派对，威尔伯因经常出现在当地商店而闻名。\n\nWilbur has his own Internet pages as he approaches his 10th birthday on July 7. 7\n月7日，威尔伯即将迎来10岁生日，他有了自己的网页。。\n\nWilbur is both bold and friendly.\n威尔伯既大胆又友好。\n\nHe spends most of his time in shops and businesses around the village.\n他大部分时间都在村子附近的商店和工厂里度过。\n\nHe''ll just take himself in to any shop, anywhere.\n他会去任何一家商店，任何地方。\n\nThere was one time when the doctor''s receptionist came back and he was sitting on her chair.\n有一次，医生的接待员回来，看到他坐在她的椅子上。\n\nAmong his favorite haunts are a local hairdresser, two pubs and the Nottingham Primary School.\n他最喜欢去的地方包括当地的一家理发店、两家酒吧和诺丁汉小学。\n\nLesley Harper who runs one of the pubs, said the cat has been a big hit with their customers.\n其中一家酒吧的老板莱斯利·哈珀说，这只猫深受顾客欢迎。\n\n“He''s been a regular visitor for most of this year,” she told the Press Association. “\n今年大部分时间他都是常客，”她告诉新闻协会。\n\n“He''s a very relaxed cat, happy for customers and villagers young and old to come in and say hello.” “\n他是一只非常放松的猫，很乐意让顾客和村庄的年轻人和老年人进来打招呼。”\n\nShe also said he is a cat of expensive tastes who likes his high-priced cat food.\n她还说他是一只品味昂贵的猫，喜欢高价猫粮。\n\nSarah Godfrey, who is organising Wilbur''s party, told the local newspaper, “Wilbur is part of our lives as he is for everyone who lives in the village.”\n组织威尔伯派对的莎拉·戈弗雷告诉当地报纸，“威尔伯是我们生活的一部分，就像他是村里每个人的一部分一样。”\n\nQuestions 5 to 7 are based on the news report you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第5至7题。\n\n5. What does the report say the village is going to do for the cat Wilbur?\n5. 报道说村里要为这只叫威尔伯的猫做什么？\n\n6. What do we learn from the report about the cat?\n6. 关于这只猫，我们从报道中知道什么？\n\n7. What does the pub owner Lesley Harper say about the cat?\n7. 酒吧老板莱斯利·哈珀怎么评价这只猫？', 81, 1415.93, 260.43, 341.55, 346.68, 368.35, NULL, NULL, 'cet4-2023-12-2-g03', 'NEWS', '[04:20.43]News Report Three｜新闻三\n[04:23.54]A village is going to throw a birthday party for an orange cat named Wilbur, who has become famous for making a regular appearance at local shops.｜一个村庄将为一只名叫威尔伯的橘黄色猫举办生日派对，威尔伯因经常出现在当地商店而闻名。\n[04:33.78]Wilbur has his own Internet pages as he approaches his 10th birthday on July 7. 7｜月7日，威尔伯即将迎来10岁生日，他有了自己的网页。。\n[04:40.12]Wilbur is both bold and friendly.｜威尔伯既大胆又友好。\n[04:43.88]He spends most of his time in shops and businesses around the village.｜他大部分时间都在村子附近的商店和工厂里度过。\n[04:48.41]He''ll just take himself in to any shop, anywhere.｜他会去任何一家商店，任何地方。\n[04:52.77]There was one time when the doctor''s receptionist came back and he was sitting on her chair.｜有一次，医生的接待员回来，看到他坐在她的椅子上。\n[04:58.30]Among his favorite haunts are a local hairdresser, two pubs and the Nottingham Primary School.｜他最喜欢去的地方包括当地的一家理发店、两家酒吧和诺丁汉小学。\n[05:05.10]Lesley Harper who runs one of the pubs, said the cat has been a big hit with their customers.｜其中一家酒吧的老板莱斯利·哈珀说，这只猫深受顾客欢迎。\n[05:12.16]“He''s been a regular visitor for most of this year,” she told the Press Association. “｜今年大部分时间他都是常客，”她告诉新闻协会。\n[05:17.38]“He''s a very relaxed cat, happy for customers and villagers young and old to come in and say hello.” “｜他是一只非常放松的猫，很乐意让顾客和村庄的年轻人和老年人进来打招呼。”\n[05:23.71]She also said he is a cat of expensive tastes who likes his high-priced cat food.｜她还说他是一只品味昂贵的猫，喜欢高价猫粮。\n[05:30.52]Sarah Godfrey, who is organising Wilbur''s party, told the local newspaper, “Wilbur is part of our lives as he is for everyone who lives in the village.”｜组织威尔伯派对的莎拉·戈弗雷告诉当地报纸，“威尔伯是我们生活的一部分，就像他是村里每个人的一部分一样。”\n[05:41.55]Questions 5 to 7 are based on the news report you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第5至7题。\n[05:46.68]5. What does the report say the village is going to do for the cat Wilbur?｜5. 报道说村里要为这只叫威尔伯的猫做什么？\n[06:08.65]6. What do we learn from the report about the cat?｜6. 关于这只猫，我们从报道中知道什么？\n[06:26.93]7. What does the pub owner Lesley Harper say about the cat?｜7. 酒吧老板莱斯利·哈珀怎么评价这只猫？', NOW(), NOW()
