  (`question_id`, `audio_url`, `transcript`, `duration_seconds`, `audio_total_seconds`, `audio_start_seconds`, `audio_end_seconds`, `question_start_seconds`, `question_end_seconds`, `answer_start_seconds`, `answer_end_seconds`, `group_key`, `listening_type`, `lrc_content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`)
SELECT
  @a_cet4_2024_06_1_01, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2024-06-1.mp3', 'News Report One\n新闻一\n\nSix people had to move away from their home to another place after a fire broke out in a building on Main Street Saturday, officials said.\n官方表示，周六主街一栋建筑发生火灾后，6个人不得不从家中搬往其他地方。\n\nFirefighters responded to the three-story building shortly after 1 pm for a reported structure fire, according to Norwalk Deputy Fire Chief Adam Markowitz.\n据诺沃克消防局副局长亚当·马科维茨称，消防员在下午1点多接到报警后对这座三层楼的建筑进行了灭火。\n\nMarkowitz said crews encountered heavy smoke coming from the second floor when they arrived.\n马科维茨说，消防人员到达现场时发现二楼浓烟滚滚。\n\nA team of about 25 firefighters then spent about 25 minutes extinguishing the flames.\n随后，一支由约25名消防员组成的小队花了大约25分钟扑灭了大火。\n\nOfficials described the structure as a mixed-use building that features commercial businesses on the first floor and residential on the second and third floors.\n据官方描述，该建筑是一座多功能建筑，一楼是商业区，二楼和三楼是住宅区。\n\nTown records list four apartments in the building.\n城镇记录显示，这栋楼里有4套公寓。\n\nDue to smoke and heat damage, the four apartments were declared uninhabitable and the six residents had to move to another place, officials said.\n官方表示，由于烟雾和高温的破坏，这4套公寓被宣布无法居住，6名居民不得不搬到其他地方。\n\nNo injuries were reported in connection with the fire.\n据报道，火灾没有造成人员伤亡。\n\nThe Norwalk Fire Marshal is investigating the cause and origin of the fire.\n诺沃克消防局局长正在调查火灾的起因。\n\nQuestions 1 and 2 are based on the news report you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第1题和第2题。\n\n1. Why did the six residents have to find another place to stay?\n1. 为什么这6位居民必须另找住处？\n\n2. What does the news report say the Norwalk Fire Marshal is doing?\n2. 新闻报道说诺沃克消防局局长在干什么？', 73, 1409.83, 37.61, 110.87, 116.43, 135.68, 91.06, 101.52, 'cet4-2024-06-1-g01', 'NEWS', '[00:37.61]News Report One｜新闻一\n[00:39.75]Six people had to move away from their home to another place after a fire broke out in a building on Main Street Saturday, officials said.｜官方表示，周六主街一栋建筑发生火灾后，6个人不得不从家中搬往其他地方。\n[00:50.28]Firefighters responded to the three-story building shortly after 1 pm for a reported structure fire, according to Norwalk Deputy Fire Chief Adam Markowitz.｜据诺沃克消防局副局长亚当·马科维茨称，消防员在下午1点多接到报警后对这座三层楼的建筑进行了灭火。\n[01:02.33]Markowitz said crews encountered heavy smoke coming from the second floor when they arrived.｜马科维茨说，消防人员到达现场时发现二楼浓烟滚滚。\n[01:09.17]A team of about 25 firefighters then spent about 25 minutes extinguishing the flames.｜随后，一支由约25名消防员组成的小队花了大约25分钟扑灭了大火。\n[01:16.54]Officials described the structure as a mixed-use building that features commercial businesses on the first floor and residential on the second and third floors.｜据官方描述，该建筑是一座多功能建筑，一楼是商业区，二楼和三楼是住宅区。\n[01:27.79]Town records list four apartments in the building.｜城镇记录显示，这栋楼里有4套公寓。\n[01:31.06]Due to smoke and heat damage, the four apartments were declared uninhabitable and the six residents had to move to another place, officials said.｜官方表示，由于烟雾和高温的破坏，这4套公寓被宣布无法居住，6名居民不得不搬到其他地方。\n[01:41.82]No injuries were reported in connection with the fire.｜据报道，火灾没有造成人员伤亡。\n[01:45.64]The Norwalk Fire Marshal is investigating the cause and origin of the fire.｜诺沃克消防局局长正在调查火灾的起因。\n[01:50.87]Questions 1 and 2 are based on the news report you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第1题和第2题。\n[01:56.43]1. Why did the six residents have to find another place to stay?｜1. 为什么这6位居民必须另找住处？\n[02:15.98]2. What does the news report say the Norwalk Fire Marshal is doing?｜2. 新闻报道说诺沃克消防局局长在干什么？', NOW(), NOW()
WHERE @a_cet4_2024_06_1_01 IS NOT NULL
