SELECT
  @a_cet4_2024_06_1_06, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2024-06-1.mp3', 'News Report Three\n新闻三\n\nGenetic researchers in China have made a clone of a star police dog.\n中国的基因研究人员已经克隆了一只明星警犬。\n\nThe clone was born in a laboratory in Beijing in December.\n这只克隆犬于12月在北京的一个实验室中诞生。\n\nTests show that the clone and her mother are almost identical genetically.\n测试表明，该克隆犬与其供体犬在基因上几乎完全相同。\n\nThe mother dog helped solve multiple murders and many other crimes.\n这只供体犬曾协助破获多起谋杀案和许多其他犯罪案件。\n\nThe clone has already performed better than traditionally bred dogs on several tests.\n克隆犬已经在多项测试中表现得比传统繁育的犬只更好。\n\nIf the clone continues to perform as well as expected, it could mean a huge reduction in the training time for police dogs, which usually takes about five years.\n如果克隆犬的表现继续如预期的那样好，这可能意味着警犬的训练时间将大大缩短，通常情况下，警犬的训练时间为5年左右。\n\nThe ultimate goal of scientists is to produce clones of talented police dogs that can be trained in months instead of years.\n科学家们的最终目标是在几个月而不是几年内就能培养出克隆的天才警犬。\n\nHowever, this goal is not yet possible due to the current costs of the technology.\n然而，由于目前该技术的成本问题，这一目标尚不可能实现。\n\nThis is not the first time a clone has been made of a star police dog.\n这并非首次克隆明星警犬。\n\nIn South Korea, six clones began working with the police in 2008.\n在韩国，2008年就已经有6只克隆犬开始协助警方工作。\n\nQuestions 5 to 7 are based on the news report you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第5至7题。\n\n5. What do the researchers'' tests show about the cloned dog?\n5. 关于克隆犬，研究人员的测试表明了什么？\n\n6. What is the scientists'' purpose in cloning police dogs?\n6. 科学家克隆警犬的目的是什么？\n\n7. Why does the news report say the scientists'' goal is not yet possible?\n7. 为什么新闻报道说科学家的目标还不可能实现？', 68, 1409.83, 294.17, 362.01, 386.91, 407.47, 323.91, 335.47, 'cet4-2024-06-1-g03', 'NEWS', '[04:54.17]News Report Three｜新闻三\n[04:55.95]Genetic researchers in China have made a clone of a star police dog.｜中国的基因研究人员已经克隆了一只明星警犬。\n[05:01.77]The clone was born in a laboratory in Beijing in December.｜这只克隆犬于12月在北京的一个实验室中诞生。\n[05:06.55]Tests show that the clone and her mother are almost identical genetically.｜测试表明，该克隆犬与其供体犬在基因上几乎完全相同。\n[05:12.71]The mother dog helped solve multiple murders and many other crimes.｜这只供体犬曾协助破获多起谋杀案和许多其他犯罪案件。\n[05:17.49]The clone has already performed better than traditionally bred dogs on several tests.｜克隆犬已经在多项测试中表现得比传统繁育的犬只更好。\n[05:23.91]If the clone continues to perform as well as expected, it could mean a huge reduction in the training time for police dogs, which usually takes about five years.｜如果克隆犬的表现继续如预期的那样好，这可能意味着警犬的训练时间将大大缩短，通常情况下，警犬的训练时间为5年左右。\n[05:35.77]The ultimate goal of scientists is to produce clones of talented police dogs that can be trained in months instead of years.｜科学家们的最终目标是在几个月而不是几年内就能培养出克隆的天才警犬。\n[05:44.54]However, this goal is not yet possible due to the current costs of the technology.｜然而，由于目前该技术的成本问题，这一目标尚不可能实现。\n[05:51.11]This is not the first time a clone has been made of a star police dog.｜这并非首次克隆明星警犬。\n[05:55.86]In South Korea, six clones began working with the police in 2008.｜在韩国，2008年就已经有6只克隆犬开始协助警方工作。\n[06:02.01]Questions 5 to 7 are based on the news report you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第5至7题。\n[06:06.88]5. What do the researchers'' tests show about the cloned dog?｜5. 关于克隆犬，研究人员的测试表明了什么？\n[06:26.91]6. What is the scientists'' purpose in cloning police dogs?｜6. 科学家克隆警犬的目的是什么？\n[06:47.77]7. Why does the news report say the scientists'' goal is not yet possible?｜7. 为什么新闻报道说科学家的目标还不可能实现？', NOW(), NOW()
WHERE @a_cet4_2024_06_1_06 IS NOT NULL
