SELECT
  @a_cet4_2024_06_1_12, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2024-06-1.mp3', 'Conversation Two\n对话二\n\nW: Hello, good afternoon.\n女：你好，下午好。\n\nI have an inquiry to make.\n我想咨询一个问题。\n\nIt''s about the vegetarian food festival you are holding on the 19th of August at the Newcastle City Hall.\n问题是关于8月19日你们在纽卡斯尔市政厅举行的素食节。\n\nM: Yes, of course. My name''s Philip. How can I help you?\n男：好的。我叫菲利普。我能为您做些什么？\n\nW: It says on your website that you are still looking for vendors.\n女：你们的网站上说你们仍在寻找销售商。\n\nAnd I grow organic vegetables on my farm, as well as doing my own home baking.\n我在自己的农场里种植有机蔬菜，同时也自己在家烘焙。\n\nWould I be able to sell both the vegetables and items baked from them at the festival?\n我能否在节日期间出售蔬菜和用蔬菜烘焙的食品？\n\nM: That''s exactly the type of thing we''re looking for.\n男：这正是我们所需要的。\n\nWe''re getting close to the deadline, however.\n不过，我们的截止日期快到了。\n\nDo you prefer to fill out an application on the web, or to print it out and fill it in by hand and then post it back to us?\n您是想在网上填写申请表，还是打印出来手动填写再寄回给我们？\n\nRemember that you will have to have all your certificates to hand when you are filling out the forms,\n请记得在填写表格时，您需要准备好所有证书，\n\nas the standards are high and they will be carefully checked before anyone will be able to sell their produce at the event.\n因为我们的标准很高，经过仔细核查这些证书后，人们才能够在活动中出售他们的产品。\n\nW: I should be fine with doing it on your website.\n女：我会在你们的网站上填写表格。\n\nAnd I already have all my certificates, as we run a small farm shop too.\n而且我已经有了所有的证书，因为我们也经营着一家小农场商店。\n\nBut can you give me your details anyway?\n不过，你能告诉我你们的详细信息吗？\n\nM: Sure. Please address it to the Organic Organization, Vendor Applications, 112 Queens Road, Newcastle, Northumbria.\n男：当然。请将其寄至诺森布里亚纽卡斯尔市女王路112号有机组织供应商申请处。\n\nThe postcode is NU29 3LJ.\n邮政编码为NU29 3LJ。\n\nRemember that the closing date is next Tuesday, the 28th of June.\n请记住，截止日期是下周二，即6月28日。\n\nW: That''s absolutely wonderful.\n女：真是太棒了。\n\nThank you so much for your help. Goodbye.\n非常感谢你的帮助。再见。\n\nQuestions 12 to 15 are based on the conversation you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的对话回答第12至15题。\n\n12. Why does the woman call the man?\n12. 女士为什么给男士打电话？\n\n13. What is the man still looking for?\n13. 男士还在找什么？\n\n14. What does the man say they are getting close to?\n14. 男士说他们正在接近什么？\n\n15. What does the man finally ask the woman to remember?\n15. 男士最后要求女士记住什么？', 95, 1409.83, 643.87, 738.75, 744.31, 762.77, 651.26, 657.23, 'cet4-2024-06-1-g05', 'LONG_DIALOGUE', '[10:43.87]Conversation Two｜对话二\n[10:47.49]W: Hello, good afternoon.｜女：你好，下午好。\n[10:49.71]I have an inquiry to make.｜我想咨询一个问题。\n[10:51.26]It''s about the vegetarian food festival you are holding on the 19th of August at the Newcastle City Hall.｜问题是关于8月19日你们在纽卡斯尔市政厅举行的素食节。\n[10:57.53]M: Yes, of course. My name''s Philip. How can I help you?｜男：好的。我叫菲利普。我能为您做些什么？\n[11:01.30]W: It says on your website that you are still looking for vendors.｜女：你们的网站上说你们仍在寻找销售商。\n[11:05.02]And I grow organic vegetables on my farm, as well as doing my own home baking.｜我在自己的农场里种植有机蔬菜，同时也自己在家烘焙。\n[11:10.26]Would I be able to sell both the vegetables and items baked from them at the festival?｜我能否在节日期间出售蔬菜和用蔬菜烘焙的食品？\n[11:16.32]M: That''s exactly the type of thing we''re looking for.｜男：这正是我们所需要的。\n[11:20.11]We''re getting close to the deadline, however.｜不过，我们的截止日期快到了。\n[11:22.81]Do you prefer to fill out an application on the web, or to print it out and fill it in by hand and then post it back to us?｜您是想在网上填写申请表，还是打印出来手动填写再寄回给我们？\n[11:30.57]Remember that you will have to have all your certificates to hand when you are filling out the forms,｜请记得在填写表格时，您需要准备好所有证书，\n[11:36.77]as the standards are high and they will be carefully checked before anyone will be able to sell their produce at the event.｜因为我们的标准很高，经过仔细核查这些证书后，人们才能够在活动中出售他们的产品。\n[11:43.63]W: I should be fine with doing it on your website.｜女：我会在你们的网站上填写表格。\n[11:46.64]And I already have all my certificates, as we run a small farm shop too.｜而且我已经有了所有的证书，因为我们也经营着一家小农场商店。\n[11:50.96]But can you give me your details anyway?｜不过，你能告诉我你们的详细信息吗？\n[11:53.47]M: Sure. Please address it to the Organic Organization, Vendor Applications, 112 Queens Road, Newcastle, Northumbria.｜男：当然。请将其寄至诺森布里亚纽卡斯尔市女王路112号有机组织供应商申请处。\n[12:04.50]The postcode is NU29 3LJ.｜邮政编码为NU29 3LJ。\n[12:08.79]Remember that the closing date is next Tuesday, the 28th of June.｜请记住，截止日期是下周二，即6月28日。\n[12:14.07]W: That''s absolutely wonderful.｜女：真是太棒了。\n[12:15.72]Thank you so much for your help. Goodbye.｜非常感谢你的帮助。再见。\n[12:18.75]Questions 12 to 15 are based on the conversation you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的对话回答第12至15题。\n[12:24.31]12. Why does the woman call the man?｜12. 女士为什么给男士打电话？\n[12:43.07]13. What is the man still looking for?｜13. 男士还在找什么？\n[13:01.17]14. What does the man say they are getting close to?｜14. 男士说他们正在接近什么？\n[13:21.24]15. What does the man finally ask the woman to remember?｜15. 男士最后要求女士记住什么？', NOW(), NOW()
WHERE @a_cet4_2024_06_1_12 IS NOT NULL
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
  `audio_url` = VALUES(`audio_url`),
  `transcript` = VALUES(`transcript`),
  `duration_seconds` = VALUES(`duration_seconds`),
