SELECT
  @a_cet4_2024_12_1_05, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2024-12-1.mp3', 'News Report Three\n新闻三\n\nA rare “thundersnow” event has taken place in Scotland.\n苏格兰发生了罕见的“雷雪”现象。\n\nAnd alarmed locals contacted police, thinking they had heard bombs going off.\n惊恐的当地居民以为自己听到了炸弹爆炸的声音，于是报了警。\n\nThe phenomenon happens when thunder and lightning mix with a heavy snowstorm—sometimes causing loud claps that can be confused with explosions.\n这种现象发生在雷电交加的暴雪天气，有时会产生巨大的声响，让人们误以为是爆炸。\n\nOne person described it as a loud boom similar to a plane crash.\n有人将其描述为类似飞机坠毁的巨大轰鸣声。\n\nAnother person was woken up in the middle of the night by what he thought was early construction work starting.\n还有人在半夜被吵醒，以为是建筑工程提前开工了。\n\nThe noise was powerful enough to shake buildings and set off car alarms.\n雷雪造成的巨大声响足以震动建筑并触发汽车警报。\n\nThe police were flooded with many calls from the public.\n警方接到了大量的民众来电。\n\nAnd they sent out a message asking people to remain calm.\n于是他们发布了一条消息，呼吁人们保持冷静。\n\nThe police assured everyone that it was just thunder and lightning rather than some military exercise.\n警方向大家保证，这只是雷电现象，而非军事演习。\n\nThe weather was the coldest it had been for the season, so people were warned to be careful when traveling outside.\n这是进入该季节以来最冷的时候，因此，人们被提醒外出旅行时要小心。\n\nIn particular, dangerous conditions, such as icy roads or wet ground, could cause difficulty for drivers.\n尤其要小心危险的路况，如道路结冰或地面湿滑，这可能会给司机行驶造成困难。\n\nThe rail service also announced potential disruptions to trains due to the deep snow.\n铁路部门也宣布，由于积雪深厚，列车运行可能会受到干扰。\n\nSome roads were also closed because of the severe weather.\n一些道路也因天气恶劣而被封锁。\n\nQuestions 5 to 7 are based on the news report you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第5至7题。\n\n5. What do we learn about thundersnows from the report?\n5. 关于雷雪，我们从报道中了解到了什么？\n\n6. What did the police do when they received the local residents’ phone calls?\n6. 警方接到当地居民的电话后做了什么？\n\n7. What were people advised to do when traveling outside?\n7. 人们被建议外出旅行时要做什么？', 83, 1426.14, 273.62, 356.67, 361.90, 381.94, 286.97, 298.23, 'cet4-2024-12-1-g03', 'NEWS', '[04:33.62]News Report Three｜新闻三\n[04:36.76]A rare “thundersnow” event has taken place in Scotland.｜苏格兰发生了罕见的“雷雪”现象。\n[04:41.43]And alarmed locals contacted police, thinking they had heard bombs going off.｜惊恐的当地居民以为自己听到了炸弹爆炸的声音，于是报了警。\n[04:46.97]The phenomenon happens when thunder and lightning mix with a heavy snowstorm—sometimes causing loud claps that can be confused with explosions.｜这种现象发生在雷电交加的暴雪天气，有时会产生巨大的声响，让人们误以为是爆炸。\n[04:58.53]One person described it as a loud boom similar to a plane crash.｜有人将其描述为类似飞机坠毁的巨大轰鸣声。\n[05:04.15]Another person was woken up in the middle of the night by what he thought was early construction work starting.｜还有人在半夜被吵醒，以为是建筑工程提前开工了。\n[05:10.80]The noise was powerful enough to shake buildings and set off car alarms.｜雷雪造成的巨大声响足以震动建筑并触发汽车警报。\n[05:16.29]The police were flooded with many calls from the public.｜警方接到了大量的民众来电。\n[05:20.16]And they sent out a message asking people to remain calm.｜于是他们发布了一条消息，呼吁人们保持冷静。\n[05:23.87]The police assured everyone that it was just thunder and lightning rather than some military exercise.｜警方向大家保证，这只是雷电现象，而非军事演习。\n[05:31.30]The weather was the coldest it had been for the season, so people were warned to be careful when traveling outside.｜这是进入该季节以来最冷的时候，因此，人们被提醒外出旅行时要小心。\n[05:38.35]In particular, dangerous conditions, such as icy roads or wet ground, could cause difficulty for drivers.｜尤其要小心危险的路况，如道路结冰或地面湿滑，这可能会给司机行驶造成困难。\n[05:46.38]The rail service also announced potential disruptions to trains due to the deep snow.｜铁路部门也宣布，由于积雪深厚，列车运行可能会受到干扰。\n[05:52.82]Some roads were also closed because of the severe weather.｜一些道路也因天气恶劣而被封锁。\n[05:56.67]Questions 5 to 7 are based on the news report you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第5至7题。\n[06:01.90]5. What do we learn about thundersnows from the report?｜5. 关于雷雪，我们从报道中了解到了什么？\n[06:22.24]6. What did the police do when they received the local residents’ phone calls?｜6. 警方接到当地居民的电话后做了什么？\n[06:42.79]7. What were people advised to do when traveling outside?｜7. 人们被建议外出旅行时要做什么？', NOW(), NOW()
WHERE @a_cet4_2024_12_1_05 IS NOT NULL
