SET @a_cet4_2025_06_1_03 = (SELECT `id` FROM `question_info` WHERE `external_key` = 'cet4-2025-06-1-q03' AND `module_type` = 4 LIMIT 1);
INSERT INTO `listening_audio`
  (`question_id`, `audio_url`, `transcript`, `duration_seconds`, `audio_total_seconds`, `audio_start_seconds`, `audio_end_seconds`, `question_start_seconds`, `question_end_seconds`, `answer_start_seconds`, `answer_end_seconds`, `group_key`, `listening_type`, `lrc_content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`)
SELECT
  @a_cet4_2025_06_1_03, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2025-06-1.mp3', 'News Report Two\n新闻二\n\nTwo arrests were announced Thursday.\n周四，司法部宣布了两起逮捕事件。\n\nThe arrests were in connection with a string of mail thefts from U.S. post services collection boxes in Marion County and for the possession of a stolen postal key, according to the Department of Justice.\n据司法部称，这两起逮捕与马里恩县美国邮政服务邮筒发生的一系列邮件盗窃案以及持有被盗的邮政钥匙有关。\n\nJordan Jax and Tarod Goodman, both 23, were arrested after evidence gathered in an investigation showed the pair stole mail on multiple occasions using a postal key, according to a news release.\n报道称在调查中收集到的证据显示，23岁的乔丹·贾克斯和塔罗德·古德曼过去曾多次使用邮政钥匙窃取邮件，随后两人被逮捕。\n\nJax and Goodman stole mail for around four months.\n贾克斯和古德曼盗窃邮件的行为持续了大约四个月。\n\nInvestigators reviewed videos of the collection boxes.\n调查人员查看了邮筒的监控视频。\n\nThe video showed the two men loading the stolen mail into Jax’s vehicle.\n视频显示，这两名男子将偷来的邮件装进了贾克斯的车。\n\nInvestigators were also able to recover the key that was used to open the collection boxes.\n调查人员还成功找回了用于打开邮筒的钥匙。\n\nJax and Goodman each face up to five years in federal prison in the mail thefts and up to ten years for possession of postal key.\n贾克斯和古德曼因邮件盗窃罪分别面临最高5年的联邦监禁，因持有邮政钥匙分别面临最高10年的监禁。\n\nQuestions 3 and 4 are based on the news report you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第3题和第4题。\n\n3. What did Jordan Jax and Tarod Goodman do according to a news release?\n3. 根据新闻稿，乔丹·贾克斯和塔罗德·古德曼做了什么？\n\n4. What do Jordan Jax and Tarod Goodman face?\n4. 乔丹·贾克斯和塔罗德·古德曼会面临什么？', 64, 1415.84, 160.35, 224.70, 229.73, 250.41, 179.60, 194.11, 'cet4-2025-06-1-g02', 'NEWS', '[02:40.35]News Report Two｜新闻二\n[02:42.45]Two arrests were announced Thursday.｜周四，司法部宣布了两起逮捕事件。\n[02:45.80]The arrests were in connection with a string of mail thefts from U.S. post services collection boxes in Marion County and for the possession of a stolen postal key, according to the Department of Justice.｜据司法部称，这两起逮捕与马里恩县美国邮政服务邮筒发生的一系列邮件盗窃案以及持有被盗的邮政钥匙有关。\n[02:59.60]Jordan Jax and Tarod Goodman, both 23, were arrested after evidence gathered in an investigation showed the pair stole mail on multiple occasions using a postal key, according to a news release.｜报道称在调查中收集到的证据显示，23岁的乔丹·贾克斯和塔罗德·古德曼过去曾多次使用邮政钥匙窃取邮件，随后两人被逮捕。\n[03:14.41]Jax and Goodman stole mail for around four months.｜贾克斯和古德曼盗窃邮件的行为持续了大约四个月。\n[03:18.75]Investigators reviewed videos of the collection boxes.｜调查人员查看了邮筒的监控视频。\n[03:22.71]The video showed the two men loading the stolen mail into Jax’s vehicle.｜视频显示，这两名男子将偷来的邮件装进了贾克斯的车。\n[03:27.98]Investigators were also able to recover the key that was used to open the collection boxes.｜调查人员还成功找回了用于打开邮筒的钥匙。\n[03:35.13]Jax and Goodman each face up to five years in federal prison in the mail thefts and up to ten years for possession of postal key.｜贾克斯和古德曼因邮件盗窃罪分别面临最高5年的联邦监禁，因持有邮政钥匙分别面临最高10年的监禁。\n[03:44.70]Questions 3 and 4 are based on the news report you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第3题和第4题。\n[03:49.73]3. What did Jordan Jax and Tarod Goodman do according to a news release?｜3. 根据新闻稿，乔丹·贾克斯和塔罗德·古德曼做了什么？\n[04:10.71]4. What do Jordan Jax and Tarod Goodman face?｜4. 乔丹·贾克斯和塔罗德·古德曼会面临什么？', NOW(), NOW()
