SELECT
  @a_cet4_2025_06_1_19, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2025-06-1.mp3', 'Passage Two\n短文二\n\nIs it a good idea to display luxury brands and other signals of status?\n展示奢侈品和其他彰显社会地位的信号是个好主意吗？\n\nIt depends on the situation.\n这取决于具体情况。\n\nStudies have shown that people who appear to be wealthy tend to be considered more intelligent, disciplined and competent than those who do not.\n研究表明，那些看似富有的人往往被认为比不富有的人更聪明、更有纪律性、更能干。\n\nBut new research found that people believe someone who shows off their social status cares more about benefiting themselves than helping others.\n但新的研究发现，人们认为那些炫耀自己社会地位的人更关心的是让自己受益，而不是帮助他人。\n\nThis means people are less willing to collaborate with them.\n这意味着人们不太愿意与他们合作。\n\nModesty may be key when cooperation is essential, but the researchers also found that in some cases, status signaling has advantages.\n在合作至关重要的情况下，谦逊可能是关键，但研究人员还发现，在某些情况下，展示社会地位也有其优势。\n\nExperiments showed that participants were less likely to choose someone who signals their wealth or status to join a group seeking cooperative members, but participants were more likely to choose that person when they were looking for a competitive team member.\n实验表明，当参与者在寻找合作型团队成员时，他们不太可能选择那些展示自己财富或地位的人；但当他们在寻找有竞争力的团队成员时，却更倾向于选择那样的人。\n\nThese findings suggest that people should change how they present themselves depending on their social goal.\n这些发现表明，人们应该根据自己的社交目的来改变展示自己的方式。\n\nThis is the era of social media.\n这是一个社交媒体时代。\n\nPeople can easily share their wealth and status to large audiences, but they need to consider the consequences.\n人们可以很容易地向广大受众分享自己的财富和地位，但他们需要考虑由此带来的后果。\n\nPosting about luxury purchases and expensive vacations online may help you to persuade others and frighten competitors, but it could also signal to potential friends or future employers that you are unlikely to think about the needs of others.\n在网上发布与奢侈品购买和昂贵的度假行程有关的帖子，可能会帮助你说服他人、吓退竞争对手，但也可能向潜在的朋友或未来的雇主发出信号，表明你不太可能考虑他人的需求。\n\nThis makes things tricky for people who may want to impress others while also demonstrating that they are a team player.\n这对于那些既想给他人留下深刻印象，又想证明自己是个良好合作伙伴的人来说，确实是个棘手的问题。\n\nQuestions 19 to 21 are based on the passage you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的短文回答第19至21题。\n\n19. How would people describe someone who shows off their social status according to new research?\n19. 根据新的研究，人们会如何描述那些炫耀自己社会地位的人?\n\n20. When were participants more likely to choose someone who signals their wealth or status?\n20. 参与者在什么情况下更倾向于选择那些展示自己财富或地位的人?\n\n21. What should people do when sharing their wealth and status online?\n21. 人们在网上分享自己的财富和地位时应该做什么?', 107, 1415.84, 1037.76, 1144.81, 1150.16, 1170.16, NULL, NULL, 'cet4-2025-06-1-g07', 'PASSAGE', '[17:17.76]Passage Two｜短文二\n[17:19.71]Is it a good idea to display luxury brands and other signals of status?｜展示奢侈品和其他彰显社会地位的信号是个好主意吗？\n[17:25.46]It depends on the situation.｜这取决于具体情况。\n[17:27.92]Studies have shown that people who appear to be wealthy tend to be considered more intelligent, disciplined and competent than those who do not.｜研究表明，那些看似富有的人往往被认为比不富有的人更聪明、更有纪律性、更能干。\n[17:38.48]But new research found that people believe someone who shows off their social status cares more about benefiting themselves than helping others.｜但新的研究发现，人们认为那些炫耀自己社会地位的人更关心的是让自己受益，而不是帮助他人。\n[17:48.64]This means people are less willing to collaborate with them.｜这意味着人们不太愿意与他们合作。\n[17:53.21]Modesty may be key when cooperation is essential, but the researchers also found that in some cases, status signaling has advantages.｜在合作至关重要的情况下，谦逊可能是关键，但研究人员还发现，在某些情况下，展示社会地位也有其优势。\n[18:03.94]Experiments showed that participants were less likely to choose someone who signals their wealth or status to join a group seeking cooperative members, but participants were more likely to choose that person when they were looking for a competitive team member.｜实验表明，当参与者在寻找合作型团队成员时，他们不太可能选择那些展示自己财富或地位的人；但当他们在寻找有竞争力的团队成员时，却更倾向于选择那样的人。\n[18:20.88]These findings suggest that people should change how they present themselves depending on their social goal.｜这些发现表明，人们应该根据自己的社交目的来改变展示自己的方式。\n[18:28.19]This is the era of social media.｜这是一个社交媒体时代。\n[18:30.67]People can easily share their wealth and status to large audiences, but they need to consider the consequences.｜人们可以很容易地向广大受众分享自己的财富和地位，但他们需要考虑由此带来的后果。\n[18:38.56]Posting about luxury purchases and expensive vacations online may help you to persuade others and frighten competitors, but it could also signal to potential friends or future employers that you are unlikely to think about the needs of others.｜在网上发布与奢侈品购买和昂贵的度假行程有关的帖子，可能会帮助你说服他人、吓退竞争对手，但也可能向潜在的朋友或未来的雇主发出信号，表明你不太可能考虑他人的需求。\n[18:56.34]This makes things tricky for people who may want to impress others while also demonstrating that they are a team player.｜这对于那些既想给他人留下深刻印象，又想证明自己是个良好合作伙伴的人来说，确实是个棘手的问题。\n[19:04.81]Questions 19 to 21 are based on the passage you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的短文回答第19至21题。\n[19:10.16]19. How would people describe someone who shows off their social status according to new research?｜19. 根据新的研究，人们会如何描述那些炫耀自己社会地位的人?\n[19:32.80]20. When were participants more likely to choose someone who signals their wealth or status?｜20. 参与者在什么情况下更倾向于选择那些展示自己财富或地位的人?\n[19:54.76]21. What should people do when sharing their wealth and status online?｜21. 人们在网上分享自己的财富和地位时应该做什么?', NOW(), NOW()
WHERE @a_cet4_2025_06_1_19 IS NOT NULL
