  (`question_id`, `audio_url`, `transcript`, `duration_seconds`, `audio_total_seconds`, `audio_start_seconds`, `audio_end_seconds`, `question_start_seconds`, `question_end_seconds`, `answer_start_seconds`, `answer_end_seconds`, `group_key`, `listening_type`, `lrc_content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`)
SELECT
  @a_cet4_2025_06_2_01, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2025-06-2.mp3', 'News Report One\n新闻一\n\nA Florida teenager and an Atlanta woman won the overall men’s and women’s divisions Saturday at the annual 7 Mile Bridge Run.\n周六，在一年一度的“七英里桥赛跑”中，一名来自佛罗里达州的青少年和一名来自亚特兰大的女士分别赢得了男子组和女子组的冠军。\n\nVaclav Bursa, 15, of Big Pine Key, Florida, finished first overall. 15\n岁的瓦茨拉夫·布尔萨来自佛罗里达州大松礁岛，最终获得了总冠军。\n\nHe completed the race in 41 minutes and one second and claimed the top spot in the men’s division.\n他以41分1秒的成绩完成了比赛，并夺得男子组的第一名。\n\nBursa won third place in the 2022 race.\n布尔萨曾在2022年的比赛中获得了第三名。\n\nHe is a student at Marathon High School.\n他是马拉松高中的一名学生。\n\nJoanna Stephens, 28, of Atlanta, completed the course in 41 minutes and 12 seconds. 28\n岁的乔安娜·斯蒂芬斯来自亚特兰大，以41分12秒的成绩完成了比赛。\n\nShe won the women’s division title and placed second overall.\n她赢得了女子组冠军，并获得总成绩第二名。\n\nThe race drew competitors from 41 U.S. states.\n此次比赛吸引了来自美国 41 个州的选手参赛。\n\nThere were also runners from other countries, including Canada, the UK and Switzerland.\n此外，还有来自加拿大、英国和瑞士等国家的选手。\n\nThe run closed the span between the Middle and Lower Keys to traffic for three hours Saturday.\n周六，为举办此次比赛，中群岛和低群岛之间的交通封闭了 3 个小时。\n\nThe April contest is one of the most popular running events in the southeastern United States.\n这场四月举办的比赛是美国东南部最受欢迎的跑步赛事之一。\n\nThe race field filled within minutes after online registration opened in January.\n今年1月网上报名通道开启后，参赛名额在几分钟内就被抢空。\n\nQuestions 1 and 2 are based on the news report you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第1题和第2题。\n\n1. What does the news report say about Vaclav Bursa and Joanna Stephens?\n1. 关于瓦茨拉夫·布尔萨和乔安娜·斯蒂芬斯，新闻报道说了什么?\n\n2. What do we learn about the April contest?\n2. 关于4月的比赛，我们了解到什么?', 80, 1425.61, 41.28, 121.54, 126.88, 147.79, 43.35, 53.83, 'cet4-2025-06-2-g01', 'NEWS', '[00:41.28]News Report One｜新闻一\n[00:43.35]A Florida teenager and an Atlanta woman won the overall men’s and women’s divisions Saturday at the annual 7 Mile Bridge Run.｜周六，在一年一度的“七英里桥赛跑”中，一名来自佛罗里达州的青少年和一名来自亚特兰大的女士分别赢得了男子组和女子组的冠军。\n[00:54.13]Vaclav Bursa, 15, of Big Pine Key, Florida, finished first overall. 15｜岁的瓦茨拉夫·布尔萨来自佛罗里达州大松礁岛，最终获得了总冠军。\n[01:01.27]He completed the race in 41 minutes and one second and claimed the top spot in the men’s division.｜他以41分1秒的成绩完成了比赛，并夺得男子组的第一名。\n[01:08.93]Bursa won third place in the 2022 race.｜布尔萨曾在2022年的比赛中获得了第三名。\n[01:13.19]He is a student at Marathon High School.｜他是马拉松高中的一名学生。\n[01:16.06]Joanna Stephens, 28, of Atlanta, completed the course in 41 minutes and 12 seconds. 28｜岁的乔安娜·斯蒂芬斯来自亚特兰大，以41分12秒的成绩完成了比赛。\n[01:24.28]She won the women’s division title and placed second overall.｜她赢得了女子组冠军，并获得总成绩第二名。\n[01:29.12]The race drew competitors from 41 U.S. states.｜此次比赛吸引了来自美国 41 个州的选手参赛。\n[01:33.76]There were also runners from other countries, including Canada, the UK and Switzerland.｜此外，还有来自加拿大、英国和瑞士等国家的选手。\n[01:40.78]The run closed the span between the Middle and Lower Keys to traffic for three hours Saturday.｜周六，为举办此次比赛，中群岛和低群岛之间的交通封闭了 3 个小时。\n[01:48.21]The April contest is one of the most popular running events in the southeastern United States.｜这场四月举办的比赛是美国东南部最受欢迎的跑步赛事之一。\n[01:54.91]The race field filled within minutes after online registration opened in January.｜今年1月网上报名通道开启后，参赛名额在几分钟内就被抢空。\n[02:01.54]Questions 1 and 2 are based on the news report you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第1题和第2题。\n[02:06.88]1. What does the news report say about Vaclav Bursa and Joanna Stephens?｜1. 关于瓦茨拉夫·布尔萨和乔安娜·斯蒂芬斯，新闻报道说了什么?\n[02:28.09]2. What do we learn about the April contest?｜2. 关于4月的比赛，我们了解到什么?', NOW(), NOW()
WHERE @a_cet4_2025_06_2_01 IS NOT NULL
