SELECT
  @a_cet4_2025_12_1_06, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2025-12-1.mp3', 'News Report Three\n新闻三\n\nA German supermarket has been ordered to destroy its chocolate rabbits after it lost a court battle with a Swiss chocolate manufacturer.\n一家德国超市在与一家瑞士巧克力生产商的官司中败诉后,被勒令销毁其巧克力兔产品。\n\nThe Swiss firm had argued its gold-wrapped chocolate rabbit deserved copyright protection from a similar product sold by the budget supermarket.\n该瑞士公司辩称，其金箔包装的巧克力兔应享有版权保护，以防止受到这家平价超市销售的类似产品的侵权。\n\nSwitzerland’s highest court agreed and overturned a ruling last year by the country’s commercial court that had sided with the supermarket.\n瑞士最高法院同意了这一诉求，并推翻了该国商事法庭去年作出的支持超市的裁决。\n\nIt ordered that all the imitation rabbits be destroyed, but suggested the chocolate needn’t be wasted.\n法院下令销毁所有仿制的巧克力兔，但建议不必浪费巧克力。\n\nIt could be melted for use in other products.\n可以将其融化后用于其他产品。\n\nIt said even though there are some differences between the two products, there was still the possibility of confusion for consumers.\n法院表示，尽管这两种产品存在一些差异，但仍有可能使消费者产生混淆。\n\nThe Swiss manufacturer’s rabbit has a red bow and bell, while the German supermarket’s has a green bow and bell.\n瑞士生产商的巧克力兔系着红色蝴蝶结和铃铛，而德国超市的巧克力兔则为绿色蝴蝶结和铃铛。\n\nThe colour of the wrapper is similar as are the illustrations of the features.\n两者的包装颜色相似，特征图案也相似。\n\nThe chocolate company has been to court before to protect its popular chocolate treat.\n这家巧克力公司之前就曾为保护其畅销的巧克力产品而诉诸法庭。\n\nLast year, a German federal court said the shade of the gold wrapping was also protected.\n去年，德国联邦法院裁定，该巧克力金箔包装的色调也受版权保护。\n\nQuestions 5 to 7 are based on the news report you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第5至7题。\n\n5. What has the German supermarket been ordered to do?\n5.这家德国超市被勒令做什么？\n\n6. What did Switzerland’s highest court suggest about the chocolate in question?\n6.瑞士最高法院对于涉案巧克力给出了怎样的建议？\n\n7. Why did Switzerland’s highest court overturn the commercial court’s ruling?\n7.瑞士最高法院为何推翻了商事法庭的裁决？', 77, 1370.96, 252.04, 328.78, 354.60, 375.20, NULL, NULL, 'cet4-2025-12-1-g03', 'NEWS', '[04:12.04]News Report Three｜新闻三\n[04:13.96]A German supermarket has been ordered to destroy its chocolate rabbits after it lost a court battle with a Swiss chocolate manufacturer.｜一家德国超市在与一家瑞士巧克力生产商的官司中败诉后,被勒令销毁其巧克力兔产品。\n[04:23.16]The Swiss firm had argued its gold-wrapped chocolate rabbit deserved copyright protection from a similar product sold by the budget supermarket.｜该瑞士公司辩称，其金箔包装的巧克力兔应享有版权保护，以防止受到这家平价超市销售的类似产品的侵权。\n[04:33.76]Switzerland’s highest court agreed and overturned a ruling last year by the country’s commercial court that had sided with the supermarket.｜瑞士最高法院同意了这一诉求，并推翻了该国商事法庭去年作出的支持超市的裁决。\n[04:43.40]It ordered that all the imitation rabbits be destroyed, but suggested the chocolate needn’t be wasted.｜法院下令销毁所有仿制的巧克力兔，但建议不必浪费巧克力。\n[04:50.40]It could be melted for use in other products.｜可以将其融化后用于其他产品。\n[04:53.64]It said even though there are some differences between the two products, there was still the possibility of confusion for consumers.｜法院表示，尽管这两种产品存在一些差异，但仍有可能使消费者产生混淆。\n[05:02.24]The Swiss manufacturer’s rabbit has a red bow and bell, while the German supermarket’s has a green bow and bell.｜瑞士生产商的巧克力兔系着红色蝴蝶结和铃铛，而德国超市的巧克力兔则为绿色蝴蝶结和铃铛。\n[05:10.36]The colour of the wrapper is similar as are the illustrations of the features.｜两者的包装颜色相似，特征图案也相似。\n[05:15.56]The chocolate company has been to court before to protect its popular chocolate treat.｜这家巧克力公司之前就曾为保护其畅销的巧克力产品而诉诸法庭。\n[05:21.08]Last year, a German federal court said the shade of the gold wrapping was also protected.｜去年，德国联邦法院裁定，该巧克力金箔包装的色调也受版权保护。\n[05:28.78]Questions 5 to 7 are based on the news report you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第5至7题。\n[05:34.26]5. What has the German supermarket been ordered to do?｜5.这家德国超市被勒令做什么？\n[05:54.60]6. What did Switzerland’s highest court suggest about the chocolate in question?｜6.瑞士最高法院对于涉案巧克力给出了怎样的建议？\n[06:15.50]7. Why did Switzerland’s highest court overturn the commercial court’s ruling?｜7.瑞士最高法院为何推翻了商事法庭的裁决？', NOW(), NOW()
WHERE @a_cet4_2025_12_1_06 IS NOT NULL
