SET @a_cet4_2025_12_2_03 = (SELECT `id` FROM `question_info` WHERE `external_key` = 'cet4-2025-12-2-q03' AND `module_type` = 4 LIMIT 1);
INSERT INTO `listening_audio`
  (`question_id`, `audio_url`, `transcript`, `duration_seconds`, `audio_total_seconds`, `audio_start_seconds`, `audio_end_seconds`, `question_start_seconds`, `question_end_seconds`, `answer_start_seconds`, `answer_end_seconds`, `group_key`, `listening_type`, `lrc_content`, `created_at`, `updated_at`)
SELECT
  @a_cet4_2025_12_2_03, '/audio/exams/listening-cet4-2025-12-2.mp3', 'News Report Two\n新闻二\n\nNettie’s House, a restaurant in America, has been hit with criticism after announcing on the website that children under the age of 10 are no longer welcome.\n美国一家名为“妮蒂之家”的餐厅在网站上宣布不再接待10岁以下儿童后遭到了批评。\n\nAmong the reasons given for the decision, the restaurant cited “noise levels, lack of space for high chairs, cleaning up crazy messes, and the liability of kids running around the restaurant”.\n对于这一决定，餐厅给出的理由包括“噪音过大，高脚椅摆放空间不足，需要清理混乱不堪的残局，以及儿童在餐厅内四处跑动带来的责任问题”。\n\nThey decided that it was time to take control.\n他们决定，是时候采取管控措施了。\n\nThe decision wasn’t made lightly, but some recent events pushed them to implement this new policy.\n这一决定并非草率之举，而是近期发生的一些事情促使他们实施这项新政策。\n\nResponding to the post, one person commented that “It is messed up beyond another level.\n针对这篇帖子，有人评论道：“这简直过分到极点了。\n\nChildren are children.\n孩子就是孩子。\n\nMums are tired and don’t have time to cook.\n妈妈们很疲惫，没时间做饭。\n\nNot welcoming children under 10 is a complete slap in the face to families.”\n不欢迎10岁以下儿童完全是一巴掌拍在了这些家庭的脸上。”\n\nHe felt so disappointed in the establishment.\n他对这家餐厅感到非常失望。\n\nThere are others, however, who showed support for the restaurant’s decision.\n也有一些人支持餐厅的决定。\n\nThey said it has the right to implement any rules it wants.\n他们认为餐厅有权实施任何它想要的规定。\n\nQuestions 3 and 4 are based on the news report you have just heard.\n请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第3题和第4题。\n\n3. What do we learn from the news report about the restaurant Nettie’s House?\n3.关于“妮蒂之家”餐厅，我们从新闻报道中能了解到什么？\n\n4. What do supporters say in response to the restaurant’s new policy?\n4.支持者对餐厅的新政策有何回应？', 64, 1406, 180.20, 244.52, 250.12, 270.66, 182.52, 205.90, 'cet4-2025-12-2-g02', 'NEWS', '[03:00.20]News Report Two｜新闻二\n[03:02.52]Nettie’s House, a restaurant in America, has been hit with criticism after announcing on the website that children under the age of 10 are no longer welcome.｜美国一家名为“妮蒂之家”的餐厅在网站上宣布不再接待10岁以下儿童后遭到了批评。\n[03:13.96]Among the reasons given for the decision, the restaurant cited “noise levels, lack of space for high chairs, cleaning up crazy messes, and the liability of kids running around the restaurant”.｜对于这一决定，餐厅给出的理由包括“噪音过大，高脚椅摆放空间不足，需要清理混乱不堪的残局，以及儿童在餐厅内四处跑动带来的责任问题”。\n[03:26.20]They decided that it was time to take control.｜他们决定，是时候采取管控措施了。\n[03:29.68]The decision wasn’t made lightly, but some recent events pushed them to implement this new policy.｜这一决定并非草率之举，而是近期发生的一些事情促使他们实施这项新政策。\n[03:36.32]Responding to the post, one person commented that “It is messed up beyond another level.｜针对这篇帖子，有人评论道：“这简直过分到极点了。\n[03:42.12]Children are children.｜孩子就是孩子。\n[03:43.80]Mums are tired and don’t have time to cook.｜妈妈们很疲惫，没时间做饭。\n[03:47.12]Not welcoming children under 10 is a complete slap in the face to families.”｜不欢迎10岁以下儿童完全是一巴掌拍在了这些家庭的脸上。”\n[03:52.32]He felt so disappointed in the establishment.｜他对这家餐厅感到非常失望。\n[03:55.56]There are others, however, who showed support for the restaurant’s decision.｜也有一些人支持餐厅的决定。\n[04:00.32]They said it has the right to implement any rules it wants.｜他们认为餐厅有权实施任何它想要的规定。\n[04:04.52]Questions 3 and 4 are based on the news report you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的新闻报道回答第3题和第4题。\n[04:10.12]3. What do we learn from the news report about the restaurant Nettie’s House?｜3.关于“妮蒂之家”餐厅，我们从新闻报道中能了解到什么？\n[04:30.96]4. What do supporters say in response to the restaurant’s new policy?｜4.支持者对餐厅的新政策有何回应？', NOW(), NOW()
