h of the year.｜毕竟现在是八月，一年中最繁忙的月份。\n[08:32.00]W: Yes, it''s like the whole world is here on holiday, including us.｜女：没错，感觉好像全世界的人都来这里度假了，我们也一样。\n[08:36.48]What will you do tomorrow?｜你明天打算做什么？\n[08:38.12]M: I haven''t decided yet.｜男：我还没决定。\n[08:40.08]I was thinking of doing what you did today, wandering the old streets and taking pictures.｜我在想就做你今天做的事，逛逛老街拍拍照。\n[08:45.68]I was also thinking of visiting the square with the Spanish Steps.｜我还想去那个有西班牙大台阶的广场看看。\n[08:49.64]W: What is that?｜女：那是什么地方？\n[08:50.44]I haven''t heard of it.｜我没听说过。\n[08:51.76]M: It''s a square where on one side there are some very wide steps with flowers that go up to a church.｜男：那个广场的一边有一些很宽的台阶，上面种着鲜花，通向一座教堂。\n[08:58.88]It''s also in all the tourist guidebooks.｜所有旅游指南上也都有它的介绍。\n[09:01.28]It''s very famous and pretty.｜它非常有名，也很好看。\n[09:03.48]I was also thinking of seeing that tomorrow.｜我也在考虑明天去看一看。\n[09:05.88]W: It sounds very nice.｜女：听起来很不错。\n[09:07.40]Do you mind if Kathy and I join you tomorrow?｜你介意我和凯茜明天跟你一起去吗？\n[09:10.08]M: Not at all.｜男：完全不介意。\n[09:11.12]I spent the whole day today pretty much alone.｜我今天一整天基本都是独自游玩。\n[09:14.04]Doing tourist stuff with others would be a welcome change.｜和别人结伴游玩是个不错的改变。\n[09:17.16]W: Let me ask her first, but I''m sure she''ll be up for it.｜女：我先去问问凯茜，不过我确定她会愿意的。\n[09:21.88]Questions 8 to 11 are based on the conversation you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的对话回答第8至11题。\n[09:27.16]8. What exhibit does the man like best in the museum he visited?｜8. 在男士参观的博物馆里，他最喜欢什么展品？\n[09:47.74]9. What does the woman say about the old city centre?｜9. 关于老城中心，女士说了什么？\n[10:07.34]10. What does the man say about the square with the Spanish Steps?｜10. 关于那个有西班牙大台阶的广场，男士说了什么？\n[10:27.56]11. What does the woman say she is going to do first?｜11. 女士说她将首先做什么？', NOW(), NOW()
