 at cafés and restaurants.｜我其实还会和朋友在咖啡馆或餐厅见面吃饭。\n[11:33.16]W: That''s great for you.｜女：对你来说这样挺好。\n[11:34.72]But my friends and family don''t live in this city, so we can''t see each other often, and I don''t have any choice but to chat with them online.｜但我的朋友和家人都不在这个城市，所以我们没法经常见面，我别无选择，只能在网上和他们聊天。\n[11:44.00]Questions 12 to 15 are based on the conversation you have just heard.｜请根据你刚听到的对话回答第12至15题。\n[11:49.56]12. Why hasn''t the man answered the woman''s text messages lately?｜12. 男士最近为什么没有回复女士的短信？\n[12:10.32]13. What was the man shocked to realize after he downloaded the app?｜13. 男士下载应用后震惊地意识到什么？\n[12:31.86]14. What did the man spend much time doing with his phone?｜14. 男士花大量时间用手机做什么？\n[12:52.44]15. Why does the woman say she has to use her mobile phone?｜15. 女士为什么说自己必须使用手机？', NOW(), NOW()
