  @a_cet6_2023_06_2_11, '/audio/exams/listening-cet6-2023-06-2.mp3', 'Passage One\n短文一\n\nAdventure sports are undeniably attractive to many energetic and thrill-seeking kids.\n冒险运动无疑吸引着许多精力充沛、寻求刺激的孩子们。\n\nSports like rock climbing, surfing, skiing, and mountain biking, thus have lots of appeal.\n因此，攀岩、冲浪、滑雪和山地自行车等运动都很有吸引力。\n\nThey don''t have many of the rules and pressures of traditional team sports, but they still have all the benefits of outdoor physical activity.\n与传统团队运动相比，它们没有那么多规则和压力，但却拥有户外体育活动的所有好处。\n\nWhen properly supervised, extreme sports can be a part of a healthy, balanced life.\n在适当的监督下，极限运动可以成为健康、平衡生活的一部分。\n\nSome adventure sports may be associated with higher risks of injury, so it''s important for kids to figure out when to take risks, and when not to.\n有些冒险运动可能会带来更高的受伤风险，所以孩子们要弄清楚什么时候可以冒险，什么时候不能冒险。\n\nRisk-free activities deprive kids of the opportunity to test themselves and overcome their fears.\n毫无风险的活动剥夺了孩子们测试自己和克服恐惧的机会。\n\nBut to some, these very risks are what makes these sports a bad choice.\n但对某些人来说，正是这些风险使这些运动成为一个糟糕的选择。\n\nThey say that extreme sports can often lead to devastating injuries, especially as young thrill-seekers may attempt feats that are too advanced for them.\n他们说，极限运动往往会导致毁灭性的伤害，尤其是寻求刺激的年轻人可能会去尝试那些对他们来说过于高端的壮举。\n\nBut let''s be real.\n但让我们现实一点吧。\n\nMost kids do all kinds of dangerous stuff whether you want them to or not.\n不管你愿不愿意，大多数孩子都会去做各种危险行为。\n\nAdventure sports have many of the same risks and dangers, but they have an additional sense of adventure, courage and autonomy that is important to foster in young children.\n冒险运动有许多此类风险和危险，但除此之外它们还有冒险感、勇气和自主性，这对幼儿培养非常重要。\n\nAs always, it''s up to parents to decide what''s best for their kids.\n像往常一样，父母应该决定什么才是对孩子最好的。\n\nBut if you do decide that adventure sports are a bit too much, do try to introduce other forms of outdoor adventures into their lives.\n但是，如果你真的认为冒险运动有点过分，一定要尝试将其他形式的户外冒险引入他们的生活。\n\nCamping under the stars, fishing, stargazing or even just playing in the wood