，有着共同的设计特征，那么整个村庄看起来会更美丽。事实也的确如此。\n\nW：It certainly did. I''m looking now at a before-and-after photo, and the change is truly remarkable.\n女：那肯定是。我现在正在看一张前后对比照片，变化真的很显著。\n\nIt''s hard to believe it''s the same place. And how do the neighbours feel now?\n很难相信这是同一个地方。邻居们现在感觉如何？\n\nM：Great pride, I would say.\n男：我得说，他们非常自豪。\n\nW：But what about the multitudes of visitors now crowding the streets?\n女：但是，他们对现在街道上拥挤着的大批游客有何感想？\n\nIs everyone happy about that?\n每个人都对此感到高兴吗？\n\nM：The tourists we receive are a blessing as they have completely revitalized the local economy. Every visitor is warmly welcome.\n男：来访游客是我们的福气，因为他们彻底振兴了当地经济。我们热烈欢迎每一位来访者。\n\nQuestions 5 to 8 are based on the conversation you have just heard.\n请根据你刚刚听到的对话回答问题5到8。\n\n5. What is the question the woman asked Mr. Grimm after the introduction?\n5. 在介绍了格林姆先生之后，女士问了什么问题？\n\n6.What do we learn about Berkton of 10 years ago?\n6. 我们对10年前的伯克顿有何了解？\n\n7.What resulted from the passing of the legislative proposal Motion 836?\n7. 立法提案836号动议通过后，结果如何？\n\n8.Why does the man say the tourists are a blessing to Berkton?\n8. 为什么男士说游客是伯克顿的福气？\n\nSection B Directions: In this section, you will hear two passages.\nB节 说明：在本节中，你将会听到两篇短文。', 121, 1548.89, 225.65, 347.00, 370.45, 387.42, NULL, NULL, 'cet6-2024-06-2-g02', 'LONG_DIALOGUE', '[03:45.65]Conversation Two｜对话二\n[03:47.45]W：Today we have a very interesting guest.｜女：今天我们邀请到了一位非常有趣的嘉宾。\n[03:50.63]Mr. Thomas Benjamin Grimm, the mayor of Berkton, is here to talk about his job and responsibilities, overseeing this charming village. Mr. Grimm, thank you for being here.｜托马斯·本杰明·格林姆先生，是伯克顿的市长，他在这里会跟我们谈一谈他管理这个迷人的村庄的工作和职责。格林姆先生，感谢您的光临。\n[04:02.08]M：Thank you for having me.｜男：感谢您邀请我。\n[04:03.69]W：I''d like to start by stating the obvious.｜女：首先，我想从描述一些显而易见的事实开始。\n[04:06.06]Berkton has become one of the most popular tourist destinations in the country, and this has happened under your watch.｜您在任期间，伯克顿已经成为这个国家最受欢迎的旅游目的地之一。\n[04:12.97]Just how did you achieve this?｜您是如何做到的？\n[04:15.52]M：