SELECT
  @a_cet6_2024_12_1_14, '/audio/exams/listening-cet6-2024-12-1.mp3', 'Passage Two\n短文二\n\nFour years ago, Jenny Weiner was in a fitness slump.\n4年前，珍妮·韦纳陷入了健康低谷。\n\nShe wanted to improve her physical and mental health.\n她想改善自己的身心健康。\n\nHowever, her workouts lacked intensity without a proper training programme to follow.\n然而，在没有适当的锻炼计划的情况下，她的锻炼缺乏强度。\n\nWhen she went to the gym, her daily ritual predominantly involved easy exercise options like jogging; she avoided more formidable exercises like lifting weights.\n当她去健身房时，她的日常习惯主要是慢跑等简单的运动；她避开了举重等更繁重的运动。\n\nA personal trainer who might push her was out of the question.\n一个可能会督促她的私人教练是不可能的。\n\nThe extravagant cost was just unaffordable.\n高昂的费用让她无法承受。\n\nShe then discovered the fitness phone app Slimmeretics.\n于是她发现了一款健身手机应用——Slimmeretics。\n\nTo use the app, you first input your profile about your previous training experiences and preferences, as well as your desired goals.\n为了使用该应用程序，你首先输入你的个人资料，包括你以前的锻炼经历和偏好，以及你的预期目标。\n\nA virtual coach then uses that information to suggest a personalised training regime.\n然后一个虚拟教练使用这些信息来提出一个个性化的锻炼方案。\n\nAfter the workout, the app''s artificial intelligence software system uses feedback from Ms.Weiner and its other 53 million users around the world to adjust future training sessions.\n锻炼结束后，这款应用的人工智能软件系统会根据韦纳和全球其他5 300万用户的反馈来调整未来的锻炼环节。\n\nNow Ms.Weiner finds the workouts exciting.\n现在，韦纳发现这些锻炼很令人兴奋。\n\nThis is because no two are ever the same.\n这是因为没有两个锻炼计划是完全相同的。\n\nAs a result, the app has helped her to lose more than 25 kilograms.\n结果，这款应用帮助她减掉了超过25公斤的体重。\n\nThe app''s mathematical approach can arrange a more meticulous workout schedule.\n这款应用的数学方法可以安排一个更细致的锻炼计划。\n\nThis has led to optimal results.\n这带来了最佳结果。\n\nHowever, some experts think that apps cannot replace human personal trainers.\n然而，一些专家认为应用程序不能取代人类私人教练。\n\nAn app cannot understand human behavior.\n一个应用程序不能理解人类的行为。\n\nIt will not comprehend that there are competing interests outside of health and fitness.\n它不会理解在健康和健身之外还有相互竞争的利益。\n\nAdditionally, a human trainer can add compassion to the workout.\n此外，真人教练可以为锻炼增加同情心。\n\nHe can also make exercise fun and sustainable.\n他还能让锻炼变得有趣并且可持续下去。\n\nTrainers can monitor whether a person is doing exercises correctly.\n教练可以监控人们是否正确地做运动。\n\nThis can safeguard against injuries.\n这可以防止受伤。\n\nAn app cannot perceive such subtleties.\n应用程序无法感知这种微妙之处。\n\nQuestions 12 to 15 are based on the passage you have just heard.\n请根据你刚刚听到的短文回答问题12到15。\n\n12. What was the problem Jenny Weiner encountered four years ago?\n12. 四年前，珍妮·韦纳遇到了什么问题？\n\n13.What can the fitness phone app Slimmeretics do according to the passage?\n13. 根据文章，手机健身应用程序Slimmeretics能做什么？\n\n14.Why does the passage say Jenny Weiner now finds the workouts exciting?\n14. 文章中说为什么珍妮·韦纳现在觉得锻炼很令人兴奋？\n\n15.What do some experts think of fitness apps like Slimmeretics?\n15. 一些专家是如何看待像Slimmeretics这样的健身应用程序的？\n\nSection C Directions: In this section, you will hear three recordings of lectures or talks followed by three or four questions.\nC节 说明：在本节中，你将会听到三篇讲座或讲话，每篇讲座或讲话后面都有三个或四个问题。', 131, 1666.14, 640.25, 770.76, 813.67, 833.71, NULL, NULL, 'cet6-2024-12-1-g04', 'PASSAGE', '[10:40.25]Passage Two｜短文二\n[10:42.97]Four years ago, Jenny Weiner was in a fitness slump.｜4年前，珍妮·韦纳陷入了健康低谷。\n[10:47.53]She wanted to improve her physical and mental health.｜她想改善自己的身心健康。\n[10:51.35]However, her workouts lacked intensity without a proper training programme to follow.｜然而，在没有适当的锻炼计划的情况下，她的锻炼缺乏强度。\n[10:57.13]When she went to the gym, her daily ritual predominantly involved easy exercise options like jogging; she avoided more formidable exercises like lifting weights.｜当她去健身房时，她的日常习惯主要是慢跑等简单的运动；她避开了举重等更繁重的运动。\n[11:08.82]A personal trainer who might push her was out of the question.｜一个可能会督促她的私人教练是不可能的。\n[11:13.25]The extravagant cost was just unaffordable.｜高昂的费用让她无法承受。\n[11:16.73]She then discovered the fitness phone app Slimmeretics.｜于是她发现了一款健身手机应用——Slimmeretics。\n[11:21.14]To use the app, you first input your profile about your previous training experiences and preferences, as well as your desired goals.｜为了使用该应用程序，你首先输入你的个人资料，包括你以前的锻炼经历和偏好，以及你的预期目标。\n[11:29.92]A virtual coach then uses that information to suggest a personalised training regime.｜然后一个虚拟教练使用这些信息来提出一个个性化的锻炼方案。\n[11:37.44]After the workout, the app''s artificial intelligence software system uses feedback from Ms.Weiner and its other 53 million users around the world to adjust future training sessions.｜锻炼结束后，这款应用的人工智能软件系统会根据韦纳和全球其他5 300万用户的反馈来调整未来的锻炼环节。\n[11:51.60]Now Ms.Weiner finds the workouts exciting.｜现在，韦纳发现这些锻炼很令人兴奋。\n[11:55.53]This is because no two are ever the same.｜这是因为没有两个锻炼计划是完全相同的。\n[11:58.85]As a result, the app has helped her to lose more than 25 kilograms.｜结果，这款应用帮助她减掉了超过25公斤的体重。\n[12:04.49]The app''s mathematical approach can arrange a more meticulous workout schedule.｜这款应用的数学方法可以安排一个更细致的锻炼计划。\n[12:10.13]This has led to optimal results.｜这带来了最佳结果。\n[12:12.87]However, some experts think that apps cannot replace human personal trainers.｜然而，一些专家认为应用程序不能取代人类私人教练。\n[12:19.25]An app cannot understand human behavior.｜一个应用程序不能理解人类的行为。\n[12:22.65]It will not comprehend that there are competing interests outside of health and fitness.｜它不会理解在健康和健身之外还有相互竞争的利益。\n[12:28.16]Additionally, a human trainer can add compassion to the workout.｜此外，真人教练可以为锻炼增加同情心。\n[12:34.11]He can also make exercise fun and sustainable.｜他还能让锻炼变得有趣并且可持续下去。\n[12:37.70]Trainers can monitor whether a person is doing exercises correctly.｜教练可以监控人们是否正确地做运动。\n[12:42.22]This can safeguard against injuries.｜这可以防止受伤。\n[12:45.87]An app cannot perceive such subtleties.｜应用程序无法感知这种微妙之处。\n[12:50.76]Questions 12 to 15 are based on the passage you have just heard.｜请根据你刚刚听到的短文回答问题12到15。\n[12:56.00]12. What was the problem Jenny Weiner encountered four years ago?｜12. 四年前，珍妮·韦纳遇到了什么问题？\n[13:14.11]13.What can the fitness phone app Slimmeretics do according to the passage?｜13. 根据文章，手机健身应用程序Slimmeretics能做什么？\n[13:33.67]14.Why does the passage say Jenny Weiner now finds the workouts exciting?｜14. 文章中说为什么珍妮·韦纳现在觉得锻炼很令人兴奋？\n[13:54.01]15.What do some experts think of fitness apps like Slimmeretics?｜15. 一些专家是如何看待像Slimmeretics这样的健身应用程序的？\n[14:13.36]Section C Directions: In this section, you will hear three recordings of lectures or talks followed by three or four questions.｜C节 说明：在本节中，你将会听到三篇讲座或讲话，每篇讲座或讲话后面都有三个或四个问题。', NOW(), NOW()
