  @a_cet6_2025_12_1_05, '/audio/exams/listening-cet6-2025-12-1.mp3', 'Conversation Two\n对话二\n\nM: It''s getting late and we''re both displaying signs of weariness.\n男：挺晚了，咱们两个看上去也都挺疲惫了。\n\nI think we should call it a day and meet again tomorrow morning.\n我觉得今天就到此为止吧，明天早上再碰头。\n\nW: Oh, come on, Jeff.\n女：哎呀，拜托，杰夫！\n\nWe are so close!\n我们就快干完了！\n\nDon''t you think we are almost done?\n你不觉得我们就快完成了吗？\n\nLet''s do two more hours, please.\n我们再干两个小时吧，求你了。\n\nM: One hour, then I''m going home.\n男：一个小时，之后我就回家。\n\nW: OK, fine. I think we are making good progress, and that with a few more amendments, we will be all done.\n女：行吧，那也行。我觉得咱们进展挺好的，再做几处修改就能彻底完工了。\n\nM: I''m sure looking forward to it.\n男：我当然盼着能早点完工。\n\nI''m so tired of this project.\n这项目我真是干够了。\n\nDon''t get me wrong.\n别误会。\n\nIt''s a great professional opportunity for me and a milestone for the company, but it''s just been so long.\n这对我来说确实是个很好的职业机会，也是公司的里程碑项目，但就是花的时间太长了。\n\nW: Yeah. Two months working on nothing but the same contract is a little tough.\n女：是啊。两个月就围着同一份合同转确实有点难熬。\n\nNevertheless, I think that with a bit of luck, we''ll be done by next week.\n不过，我觉得运气好的话，咱们下周就能做完。\n\nM: Ha, you must be delusional.\n男：哈，你一定是妄想。\n\nW: You don''t think so?\n女：你不这么认为吗？\n\nM: No chance. Sections 4, 5, 8 and 9 still have to be aligned to the new framework.\n男：根本不可能。第4、5、8、9节还得对照新框架重新调整。\n\nThen we need to proofread the whole thing and make sure all selling points are watertight.\n之后还得通篇校对，确保所有卖点都无懈可击。\n\nW: But that will all take no more than a couple of days.\n女：可这些活最多两天就能干完啊。\n\nM: I wasn''t finished.\n男：我还没说完呢。\n\nWhen we are done with it and send it upstairs, what do you think will happen?\n等咱们弄完了，交到楼上，你觉得下一步会怎样？\n\nW: What?\n女：会怎样？\n\nM: They''ll argue about it for like a month.\n男：他们会为此争论上个把月。\n\nThere''s always going to be the odd board member who intervenes and demands rectifications be made.\n总会有个别董事会成员干预，要求修改。\n\nThey might think that being helpful, but in reality that being obstructive and hampering progress.\n他们可能觉得自己是在帮忙，但实际上却是在添乱，拖慢进度。\n\nW: Oh, Jeff, you''re too preoccupied and cynical.\n女：哦，杰夫，你就是想得太多了，还这么悲观。\n\nIt won''t be anywhere as bad as that.\n根本不会那么糟的。\n\nYou''ll see, the entire managerial hierarchy wants to see this project implemented as soon as possible, and the board, too, is virtually unanimous in its support.\n你等着瞧，管理层上上下下都希望这个项目能尽快落地，董事会也应该会全票支持。\n\nGo on then, let''s stop there and meet up again same time tomorrow.\n行了，今天就到这儿，明天同一时间咱们再碰头。\n\nQuestions 5 to 8 are based on the conversation you have just heard.\n请根据你刚刚听到的对话回答问题5到8。\n\n5. Why does the man suggest they call it a day?\n5.男士为什么建议今天到此为止？\n\n6. What does the woman say is a little tough?\n6.女士说什么事情有点难熬？\n\n7. What does the man say the woman must be in thinking they''ll finish by next week?\n7.男士说女士觉得他们下周能完工一定是什么？\n\n8. What does the entire managerial hierarchy want to see according to the woman?\n8.根据女士的说法，管理层上上下下都希望看到什么？\n\nSection B\nB节', 109, 1543.76, 235.16, 344.36, 349.12, 365.84, 262.04, 265.74, 'cet6-2025-12-1-g02', 'LONG_DIALOGUE', '[03:55.16]Conversation Two｜对话二\n[03:57.52]M: It''s getting late and we''re both displaying signs of weariness.｜男：挺晚了，咱们两个看上去也都挺疲惫了。\n[04:01.76]I think we should call it a day and meet again tomorrow morning.｜我觉得今天就到此为止吧，明天早上再碰头。\n[04:05.00]W: Oh, come on, Jeff.｜女：哎呀，拜托，杰夫！\n[04:06.17]We are so close!｜我们就快干完了！\n[04:07.44]Don''t you think we are almost done?｜你不觉得我们就快完成了吗？\n[04:09.40]Let''s do two more hours, please.｜我们再干两个小时吧，求你了。\n[04:12.36]M: One hour, then I''m going home.｜男：一个小时，之后我就回家。\n[04:14.44]W: OK, fine. I think we are making good progress, and that with a few more amendments, we will be all done.｜女：行吧，那也行。我觉得咱们进展挺好的，再做几处修改就能彻底完工了。\n[04:22.04]M: I''m sure looking forward to it.｜男：我当然盼着能早点完工。\n[04:23.92]I''m so tired of this project.｜这项目我真是干够了。\n[04:26.04]Don''t get me wrong.｜别误会。\n[04:27.52]It''s a great professional opportunity for me and a milestone for the company, but it''s just been so long.｜这对我来说确实是个很好的职业机会，也是公司的里程碑项目，但就是花的时间太长了。\n[04:34.24]W: Yeah. Two months working on nothing but the same contract is a little tough.｜女：是啊。两个月就围着同一份合同转确实有点难熬。\n[04:39.24]Nevertheless, I think that with a bit of luck, we''ll be done by next week.｜不过，我觉得运气好的话，咱们下周就能做完。\n[04:43.92]M: Ha, you must be delusional.｜男：哈，你一定是妄想。\n[04:46.52]W: You don''t think so?｜女：你不这么认为吗？\n[04:47.92]M: No chance. Sections 4, 5, 8 and 9 still have to be aligned to the new framework.｜男：根本不可能。第4、5、8、9节还得对照新框架重新调整。\n[04:54.60]Then we need to proofread the whole thing and make sure all selling points are watertight.｜之后还得通篇校对，确保所有卖点都无懈可击。\n[05:00.12]W: But that will all take no more than a couple of days.｜女：可这些活最多两天就能干完啊。\n[05:03.44]M: I wasn''t finished.｜男：我还没说完呢。\n[05:04.84]When we are done with it and send it upstairs, what do you think will happen?｜等咱们弄完了，交到楼上，你觉得下一步会怎样？\n[05:09.12]W: What?｜女：会怎样？\n[05:09.68]M: They''ll argue about it for like a month.｜男：他们会为此争论上个把月。\n[05:12.52]There''s always going to be the odd board member who intervenes and demands rectifications be made.｜总会有个别董事会成员干预，要求修改。\n[05:17.84]They might think that being helpful, but in reality that being obstructive and hampering progress.｜他们可能觉得自己是在帮忙，但实际上却是在添乱，拖慢进度。\n[05:23.20]W: Oh, Jeff, you''re too preoccupied and cynical.｜女：哦，杰夫，你就是想得太多了，还这么悲观。\n[05:26.68]It won''t be anywhere as bad as that.｜根本不会那么糟的。\n[05:28.44]You''ll see, the entire managerial hierarchy wants to see this project implemented as soon as possible, and the board, too, is virtually unanimous in its support.｜你等着瞧，管理层上上下下都希望这个项目能尽快落地，董事会也应该会全票支持。\n[05:39.32]Go on then, let''s stop there and meet up again same time tomorrow.｜行了，今天就到这儿，明天同一时间咱们再碰头。\n[05:44.36]Questions 5 to 8 are based on the conversation you have just heard.｜请根据你刚刚听到的对话回答问题5到8。\n[05:49.12]5. Why does the man suggest they call it a day?｜5.男士为什么建议今天到此为止？\n[06:06.14]6. What does the woman say is a little tough?｜6.女士说什么事情有点难熬？\n[06:22.88]7. What does the man say the woman must be in thinking they''ll finish by next week?｜7.男士说女士觉得他们下周能完工一定是什么？\n[06:41.94]8. What does the entire managerial hierarchy want to see according to the woman?｜8.根据女士的说法，管理层上上下下都希望看到什么？\n[07:00.88]Section B｜B节', NOW(), NOW()
